A local address lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/meme in prose.

A session address lar://alias:grant@host/a.b.c/path in prose.

An address with a fragment lar:///a.b.c/path#section in prose.

Two addresses lar:///a.b.c and lar:///d.e.f on one line.

An ordinary URL https://example.com beside lar:///a.b.c
